@baseUrl = http://localhost:5266

### Step 1 — Login to get token (run first)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": "tclaiborne",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

###

### Step 2 — Get all bank accounts → expect 200 + list of active accounts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 3 — Add a new bank account → expect 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "Chase",
  "nickname": "Main Checking",
  "startingBalance": 5000
}

###

### Step 4 — Add same bank again → expect 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "Chase",
  "nickname": "Duplicate",
  "startingBalance": 1000
}

###

### Step 5 — Deposit to bank account → expect 200 + updated balance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts/5/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000000
}

###

### Step 6 — Withdraw from bank account → expect 200 + updated balance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts/5/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200
}

###

### Step 7 — Withdraw more than balance → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts/5/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 9999999
}

###

### Step 8 — Request deposit (bank → portfolio) → expect 201 + Pending status
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankAccountId": 5,
  "amount": 15000
}

###

### Step 9 — Get pending transfers → expect 200 + the transfer from step 8
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 10 — Approve the pending deposit → expect 200 + Approved status
### Replace {id} with the fundTransferId from step 8 response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/5/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 11 — Verify portfolio cash increased after approve
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 12 — Verify bank account balance decreased after approve
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 13 — Request withdrawal (portfolio → bank) → expect 201 + Pending
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/withdrawal
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankAccountId": 5,
  "amount": 5000
}

###

### Step 14 — Reject the pending withdrawal → expect 200 + Rejected status
### Replace {id} with the fundTransferId from step 13 response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/6/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 15 — Verify no balance changes after reject
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 16 — Get transfer history → expect resolved transfers only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/history
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 17 — Request deposit more than bank balance → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankAccountId": 1,
  "amount": 9999999
}

###

### Step 18 — Request withdrawal more than portfolio cash → expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/withdrawal
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankAccountId": 1,
  "amount": 9999999
}

###

### Step 19 — Deactivate a bank account → expect 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts/5
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 20 — Verify deactivated account no longer appears → expect 200 + shorter list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###

### Step 21 — Re-add the same bank → expect 201 (reactivation path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bankName": "Chase",
  "nickname": "Reactivated",
  "startingBalance": 2000
}

###

### Step 22 — Hit bank accounts without token → expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bank-accounts

###

### Step 23 — Hit transfers without token → expect 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/transfers/pending